                        <div class="agent-zoom" style="--z: 2.8; --o: 100% 17%"><Picture src={estateSale} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[640]} sizes="200px" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
                        <div class="agent-zoom" style="--z: 2.8; --o: 58% 81%"><Picture src={estateSale} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[640]} sizes="200px" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
                        <div class="agent-zoom" style="--z: 2.8; --o: 38% 100%"><Picture src={estateAuction} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[640]} sizes="200px" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
                      </div>
                      <p class="agent-bar"><i></i></p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="agent-hint"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="agent-face agent-back" aria-hidden="true">
                    <p class="agent-kicker">Uploading</p>
                    <h3>No retyping, no sorting.</h3>
                    <p>Photos are matched to the right piece and uploaded to its listing, ready to go live without anyone keying it all in.</p>
                    <span class="agent-hint"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="agent-item">
                <button type="button" class="agent-flip" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Writing descriptions: show more"></button>
                <div class="agent-flipper">
                  <div class="agent-face agent-front" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="agent-photo agent-zoom" style="--z: 2.7; --o: 76% 28%"><Picture src={estateSale} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[720, 1152]} sizes="640px" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
                    <div class="agent-panel">
                      <p class="agent-head"><i></i>Writing description</p>
                      <p class="agent-copy">Antique mantel clock with Roman numerals and a carved wood case. A handsome piece for any shelf.<u></u></p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="agent-hint"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="agent-face agent-back" aria-hidden="true">
                    <p class="agent-kicker">Describing</p>
                    <h3>Words that do it justice.</h3>
                    <p>An agent writes a clear description of each piece: what it is, what makes it special and what condition it is in.</p>
                    <span class="agent-hint"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="agent-item">
                <button type="button" class="agent-flip" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Optimizing: show more"></button>
                <div class="agent-flipper">
                  <div class="agent-face agent-front" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="agent-photo agent-zoom" style="--z: 2.4; --o: 60% 20%"><Picture src={antiquesTable} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[720, 1280]} sizes="520px" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
                    <div class="agent-panel">
                      <p class="agent-head"><i></i>Optimizing listing</p>
                      <p class="agent-before">Old painting</p>
                      <p class="agent-row agent-row-strong"><span>Landscape painting in a gilt frame</span></p>
                      <p class="agent-check">Keywords added</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="agent-hint"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="agent-face agent-back" aria-hidden="true">
                    <p class="agent-kicker">Optimizing</p>
                    <h3>Easy to find, fairly priced.</h3>
                    <p>Titles, keywords and prices are tuned so each piece shows up when the right person goes looking for it.</p>
                    <span class="agent-hint"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="agent-item">
                <button type="button" class="agent-flip" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Finding buyers: show more"></button>
                <div class="agent-flipper">
                  <div class="agent-face agent-front" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="agent-photo"><img src="/hero-family-poster.jpg" width="1280" height="720" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
                    <div class="agent-panel">
                      <p class="agent-head"><i></i>Finding buyers</p>
                      <p class="agent-row"><span>Clock collectors</span><em>Notified</em></p>
                      <p class="agent-row"><span>Antique dealers</span><em>Notified</em></p>
                      <p class="agent-row"><span>Nearby shoppers</span><em>Notified</em></p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="agent-hint"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="agent-face agent-back" aria-hidden="true">
                    <p class="agent-kicker">Finding buyers</p>
                    <h3>Loved again, by the right person.</h3>
                    <p>Agents look for the people most likely to want each piece, from collectors and dealers to shoppers nearby, and let them know.</p>
                    <span class="agent-hint"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="agent-item">
                <button type="button" class="agent-flip" aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Making ads: show more"></button>
                <div class="agent-flipper">
                  <div class="agent-face agent-front" aria-hidden="true">
                    <div class="agent-photo"><Picture src={estateAuction} formats={['avif', 'webp']} widths={[400, 720]} sizes="320px" alt="" loading="lazy" /></div>
                    <div class="agent-panel agent-ad">
                      <p class="agent-head"><i></i>Ad ready</p>
                      <p class="agent-ad-line">Floral china, ready for a new table.</p>
                      <span class="agent-ad-cta">See the sale</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="agent-hint"></span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="agent-face agent-back" aria-hidden="true">
                    <p class="agent-kicker">Making ads</p>
                    <h3>Your gems get their own ads.</h3>
                    <p>An agent writes and designs ads for your best pieces, so the sale reaches people well beyond your street.</p>
                    <span class="agent-hint"></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <h2 class="agents-line">
              {agentLine.split(' ').map((word) => (
                <><span class="agents-word">{word}</span>{' '}</>
              ))}
            </h2>
          </div>
        </div>
